vel":2,"wikitext":"Mr. MacTavish was under orders from DeFoe to recover [[Eathon Lambert's journal]] from [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]]. He was the first Suit to break in [[Lok's dormitory]]. After a long chase, MacTavish and the Suits finally cornered Lok, but [[Dante Vale]] arrived to save him. This angered MacTavish but after a brief battle, he and his fellow agents ran away. He returned later with Defoe, [[Grier]] and reinforcements. {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nHe was one of the many Suits called in by [[DeFoe]] to stop Dante, Lok, and Sophie in the Venice Huntik Library. Managing to get within proximity of Sophie, MacTavish nearly hit her directly, but the attack was intercepted by Dante. MacTavish, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and [[Santiago]]. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}\n\nHe later guarded the Organization safehouse on the [[Road of Alchemists]]. He was then knocked out by [[Lok Lambert]] using his [[Overslam]] power. {{Source|Chasing Void}}","text":"Mr. MacTavish was under orders from DeFoe to recover Eathon Lambert's journal from Lok Lambert and Sophie Casterwill. He was the first Suit to break in Lok's dormitory. After a long chase, MacTavish and the Suits finally cornered Lok, but Dante Vale arrived to save him. This angered MacTavish but after a brief battle, he and his fellow agents ran away. He returned later with Defoe, Grier and reinforcements. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nHe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante, Lok, and Sophie in the Venice Huntik Library. Managing to get within proximity of Sophie, MacTavish nearly hit her directly, but the attack was intercepted by Dante. MacTavish, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. [The Casterwill Client]\n\nHe later guarded the Organization safehouse on the Road of Alchemists. He was then knocked out by Lok Lambert using his Overslam power. [Chasing Void]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, MacTavish was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{Col-begin}}\n{{Col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, MacTavish was issued with the standard Organization Titans."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"*[[Augerfrost]]\n*[[Hyperstride]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n\n{{Col-2}}","text":"*Augerfrost\n*Hyperstride\n*Raypulse"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"*[[Mindrone]]\n*[[Redcap]]\n*[[Strix]]\n\n{{Col-end}}","text":"*Mindrone\n*Redcap\n*Strix"},{"heading":"Trivia","level":2,"wikitext":"* He is the first [[Suits|Suit]] to appear on screen, also the first character to use any power on screen with [[Augerfrost]].","text":"* He is the first Suit to appear on screen, also the first character to use any power on screen with Augerfrost."},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\" widths=\"185\">\nS1E01 MacTavish Augerfrost.png|Mr. MacTavish using [[Augerfrost]]\nS1E01 MacTavish.png|Mr. MacTavish looking over the river\nS1E02 Mactavish invokes Redcap 2.png|Mr. MacTavish invoking [[Redcap]]\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Suits]]\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]","text":"S1E01 MacTavish Augerfrost.png|Mr. MacTavish using Augerfrost\nS1E01 MacTavish.png|Mr. MacTavish looking over the river\nS1E02 Mactavish invokes Redcap 2.png|Mr. MacTavish invoking Redcap"}],"full_text":"Mr. MacTavish is a Suit working for the Organization. He is one the agents working in Venice, Italy, and in Prague, Czech Republic. He was commanded by DeFoe.\n\n== History ==\nMr. MacTavish was under orders from DeFoe to recover Eathon Lambert's journal from Lok Lambert and Sophie Casterwill. He was the first Suit to break in Lok's dormitory. After a long chase, MacTavish and the Suits finally cornered Lok, but Dante Vale arrived to save him. This angered MacTavish but after a brief battle, he and his fellow agents ran away. He returned later with Defoe, Grier and reinforcements. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nHe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante, Lok, and Sophie in the Venice Huntik Library. Managing to get within proximity of Sophie, MacTavish nearly hit her directly, but the attack was intercepted by Dante. MacTavish, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. [The Casterwill Client]\n\nHe later guarded the Organization safehouse on the Road of Alchemists. He was then knocked out by Lok Lambert using his Overslam power. [Chasing Void]\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, MacTavish was issued with the standard Organization Titans.\n\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n*Augerfrost\n*Hyperstride\n*Raypulse\n\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n*Mindrone\n*Redcap\n*Strix\n\n==Trivia==\n* He is the first Suit to appear on screen, also the first character to use any power on screen with Augerfrost.\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nS1E01 MacTavish Augerfrost.png|Mr. MacTavish using Augerfrost\nS1E01 MacTavish.png|Mr. MacTavish looking over the river\nS1E02 Mactavish invokes Redcap 2.png|Mr. MacTavish invoking Redcap","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image    = Mr._Mactavish.jpg\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br>[[Suits]]\n| base   = [[Venice, Italy]]<br>[[Prague, Czech Republic]]\n| gender   = Male\n| hair     = Orange\n| eyes     = Brown\n| first    = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"\n| american = Sean Schemmel\n}}\n'''Mr. MacTavish''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]]. He is one the agents working in [[Venice, Italy]], and in [[Prague, Czech Republic]]. He was commanded by [[DeFoe]].\n\n== History ==\nMr. MacTavish was under orders from DeFoe to recover [[Eathon Lambert's journal]] from [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]]. He was the first Suit to break in [[Lok's dormitory]]. After a long chase, MacTavish and the Suits finally cornered Lok, but [[Dante Vale]] arrived to save him. This angered MacTavish but after a brief battle, he and his fellow agents ran away. He returned later with Defoe, [[Grier]] and reinforcements. {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nHe was one of the many Suits called in by [[DeFoe]] to stop Dante, Lok, and Sophie in the Venice Huntik Library. Managing to get within proximity of Sophie, MacTavish nearly hit her directly, but the attack was intercepted by Dante. MacTavish, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and [[Santiago]]. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}\n\nHe later guarded the Organization safehouse on the [[Road of Alchemists]]. He was then knocked out by [[Lok Lambert]] using his [[Overslam]] power. {{Source|Chasing Void}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, MacTavish was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{Col-begin}}\n{{Col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n*[[Augerfrost]]\n*[[Hyperstride]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n\n{{Col-2}}\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n*[[Mindrone]]\n*[[Redcap]]\n*[[Strix]]\n\n{{Col-end}}\n\n==Trivia==\n* He is the first [[Suits|Suit]] to appear on screen, also the first character to use any power on screen with [[Augerfrost]].\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\" widths=\"185\">\nS1E01 MacTavish Augerfrost.png|Mr. MacTavish using [[Augerfrost]]\nS1E01 MacTavish.png|Mr. MacTavish looking over the river\nS1E02 Mactavish invokes Redcap 2.png|Mr. MacTavish invoking [[Redcap]]\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Suits]]\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_id":"huntik:page:8056","target_url"